  "headline": "Bareskrim Polri Seizes Documents From Bogor Site In Treason Probe",
  "seoTitle": "Bareskrim Polri Treason Investigation Bogor Raid",
  "metaDescription": "Indonesian police seized documents and banners from a house in Bogor allegedly used as a base for treason, involving high-ranking police officials.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri searched a residence in Cibinong, Bogor, suspected of serving as a base for planning treason activities.",
    "Investigators seized several documents and banners during the raid, which are believed to be linked to the alleged treason scheme.",
    "The investigation involves high-ranking officers, including Brig. Gen. Tedjo Kusumo and Sr. Comr. Iman Imanuddin, as authorities continue evidence collection."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Bareskrim Polri) are conducting an investigation into alleged treason acts directed against President Prabowo. As part of this inquiry, authorities carried out raids on several properties, including a house in Cibinong, Bogor, and others in Tangerang. Officials identified the searched locations as bases linked to senior police officers, specifically Brig. Gen. Tedjo Kusumo and Sr. Comr. Iman Imanuddin. During the operation in Bogor, investigators recovered various documents and banners deemed relevant to the planning of treasonous actions. Police officials stated they are still in the process of gathering evidence and have delayed an official public exposition of the case while they finalize their inquiries. The investigation remains ongoing as authorities work to determine the scope of the alleged conspiracy and establish formal suspect designations based on the evidence collected.",
